 More Annoying Ads or Pop-ups:\n    All banner ads, full-screen pop-ups, and annoying cookie banners are\n    instantly hidden.\n\n  - No Scrolling Needed:\n    The webpage is cleaned up and rearranged so the main green Proceed / Access\n    button is placed right at the top under the title, saving you from scrolling\n    through random text or fake buttons.\n\n  - Automatic Task Handler:\n    When you click a task button (like visiting a website or opening a link),\n    Purify pops it open in a tiny mini-window, closes it automatically after 5\n    seconds, and shows a clean countdown timer on your screen while it finishes\n    the task for you.\n\n  - Automatic Fake Email Sign-In:\n    If the site asks you to sign in with an email to continue, Purify creates a\n    temporary fake email, solves the security check, grabs the verification\n    code, and types it in for you automatically without you ever opening an\n    inbox.\n\n  - Auto-Mutes All Noise:\n    If a webpage tries to play loud video ads or background music, Purify\n    instantly mutes all sound so your browser stays completely silent.\n\n  - Instant MediaFire Downloads:\n    Once you finally reach the MediaFire download page, Purify clicks the\n    download button for you immediately and closes the MediaFire tab as soon as\n    your download starts.\n\n  - Status Badge:\n    A small green status dot appears in the top-right corner of your screen\n    showing you that Purify is active and working.\n\nAND Its open-sourced.\n\nThis is a TamperMonkey script basic knowledge is needed to use.\nInstall Tampermonkey onto Opera and then open the script link below.\nOptionally a clean version of opera portable (all official files signed and everything) is hosted at: https://github.com/tomatotxt/CleanOpera/raw/refs/heads/main/cleanoperalink.","tags":["workink","bypass","free","keyless","working"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/Srs7r9y5yZ","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","v